  "releaseNotes": "v0.11.0. New: ErpPage<T>.SkippedWithAmountCount reports how many customer or vendor rows skipped for having no number carried a non-zero balance, and null when that is not proven; total it across pages with ErpSkippedTally, never LINQ Sum. Improvements: vendor invoice attachments read both response forms. Fixes: customer and product attachment downloads read the raw file DK Plus actually returns, with the name from Content-Disposition, instead of failing with a contract error; the JSON form still works.",
